Package: immich-mount-kde
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Jakob Hviid <jakob@hviid.phd>
Depends: immich-mount (= @VERSION@), @QT_DEPENDS@, qml6-module-qtquick-controls, qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, qml6-module-org-kde-kirigami, qml6-module-org-kde-desktop, libkf6config-bin, xdg-utils, desktop-file-utils
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/jakobhviid/immich-mount
Description: Immich Mount for KDE Plasma: sign in, status and settings for the Immich drive in Dolphin
 Signs in to a self-hosted Immich server (single sign-on in the browser, email and
 password, or an API key), keeps the credential in KWallet or another keyring, and
 starts the mount that shows the library in Dolphin.
 .
 Immich Mount is an independent, unofficial project. It is not affiliated with,
 endorsed by, or sponsored by the Immich project or FUTO. "Immich" is used only to
 describe the server this software works with, and remains the mark of its owner.
